Shushu.

116
00:10:57,626 --> 00:10:59,477
Please feel free to unwind in the bath.

117
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:01,089
I think I'll do just that.

118
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:03,840
Yuki, stand by in your slave form.

119
00:11:04,100 --> 00:11:06,629
Come get me at the
first sign of an attack.

120
