122
00:11:10,380 --> 00:11:12,321
Are you up to eating some dinner?

123
00:11:12,680 --> 00:11:13,510
Uh, sure.

124
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,260
Are you okay?

125
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:18,776
Are you in any pain?

126
00:11:19,300 --> 00:11:20,740
No, I'm fine.

127
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:23,417
It's just, the others are...

128
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:26,397
The Demon Defense Force has
a talented medical team.

129
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:28,317
They'll bounce back soon enough.

130
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:30,740
Yeah, that's what Ms. Kyoka said.

131
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:34,980
If something happens,

132
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:39,769
it's your job to work extra hard on
behalf of everyone who's in the hospital.

133
00:11:42,340 --> 00:11:45,720
So eat something when you
can, and try to cheer up!

134
