135
00:11:48,140 --> 00:11:49,700
You got it, thanks.

136
00:11:53,060 --> 00:11:55,317
It's okay, I'll go grab you some food.

137
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:57,657
Oh, take your time, and be careful.

138
00:11:57,740 --> 00:12:00,840
Don't worry, I'm your senpai, remember?

139
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:12,280
