189
00:15:18,180 --> 00:15:20,840
So this is one of Yuki's famous meals.

190
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,960
It looks and smells delicious!

191
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:26,197
We'll make ramen with the leftover broth.

192
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:27,110
Yes, please!

193
00:15:27,380 --> 00:15:30,497
