198
00:15:40,620 --> 00:15:44,697
You love that kind of stuff, and you're
always sneaking snacks and sweets, silly.

199
00:15:44,780 --> 00:15:47,297
Hey, guys, I think we
should, uh... Come on.

200
00:15:47,380 --> 00:15:49,280
Let's raise a toast. Yeah.

201
00:15:49,580 --> 00:15:50,920
Everyone grab a glass.

202
00:15:54,660 --> 00:15:55,840
Oh, that's right.

203
00:15:56,460 --> 00:15:58,460
You are the star this time around.

204
00:15:58,660 --> 00:16:02,820
You should give a speech. Huh?
Me? Give the speech? Mm-hmm.

205
00:16:05,860 --> 00:16:07,040
Uh, okay then.

206
00:16:08,220 --> 00:16:12,380
Uh, I want to thank each and every
one of you for coming to save me.

207
00:16:12,540 --> 00:16:13,757
It's something I'll never...

208
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:15,080
Time's up! Kanpai!

209
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:16,830
Kanpai!

210
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:21,920
Now, what should I eat first?

211
00:16:23,900 --> 00:16:25,837
I mean, yeah, I can do it myself.

212
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:27,449
My food is Yuki's cooking.

213
00:16:27,620 --> 00:16:28,450
It's the best.

214
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:31,317
Yeah, and they got to help out a lot, too.

215
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:34,820
Are you absolutely sure I
can't have Yuki? Shut up.

216
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:37,140
Um, guys?

217
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:39,680
That reminds me, Yuki.

218
00:16:40,500 --> 00:16:43,957
We forgot to tell you something
while we were in the hospital.

219
00:16:44,040 --> 00:16:45,560
Welcome home, Yuki.

220
00:16:51,220 --> 00:16:52,800
I'm glad to be here.

221
00:16:59,780 --> 00:17:00,820
Big Sis.

222
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:04,940
That's an easy one. Huh?

223
00:17:06,720 --> 00:17:09,220
I just have to become Supreme Commander.

224
00:17:11,140 --> 00:17:14,000
I'll change the Demon
Defense Forces policies.

225
00:17:14,920 --> 00:17:16,457
I'll exterminate the Shuki,

226
00:17:16,540 --> 00:17:20,197
protect Aoba and her friends,
and then find a way to cure them.

227
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:21,456
How does that sound?

228
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:27,020
In that case, we might finally
get to rest easy. Big Sis!

229
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:29,960
An earthquake!

230
00:17:30,540 --> 00:17:32,000
The cave's collapsing!

231
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:34,280
We need to leave now! Got it!

232
00:17:35,380 --> 00:17:37,204
Let's get to the exit together!

233
00:17:39,940 --> 00:17:40,920
Big Sis!

234
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:48,820
Fix that for me. Huh?

235
00:17:50,380 --> 00:17:51,340
Hold on!

236
00:17:53,380 --> 00:17:54,420
It's all right.

237
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:56,249
I'll be watching over you.

238
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,358
Time's running out.

239
00:17:59,940 --> 00:18:00,770
Yuki.

240
00:18:00,853 --> 00:18:03,760
I swear, I will find a way to help you.

241
00:18:03,980 --> 00:18:05,720
I will always fight for you.

242
00:18:07,140 --> 00:18:08,840
You've gotten so strong.

243
00:18:09,140 --> 00:18:10,140
You get an A+.

244
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:13,910
Thanks.

245
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:24,020
Up till now, I've been fighting
because I wanted to be a hero.

246
00:18:24,540 --> 00:18:28,020
But now I have a much
more important purpose.

247
00:18:28,380 --> 00:18:30,040
To cure my big sister.

248
00:18:30,540 --> 00:18:32,305
That's my reason for fighting.

249
00:18:42,280 --> 00:18:43,400
Good morning.

250
00:18:44,480 --> 00:18:45,310
Tenka?

251
00:18:45,393 --> 00:18:46,820
What are you doing in my room?

252
00:18:47,080 --> 00:18:48,315
I told you, didn't I?

253
00:18:48,540 --> 00:18:51,658
That I expected a generous
reward when we were alone.

254
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:55,480
I was admiring your adorable
face while you slept.

255
00:18:56,040 --> 00:18:56,870
Yuki!

256
00:18:56,953 --> 00:18:58,915
How long are you going to stay in bed?

257
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:02,750
Uh...

258
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:08,437
Seriously, given your recent absence,
don't you have paperwork to catch up on?

259
00:19:08,520 --> 00:19:09,579
How right you are!

260
00:19:12,500 --> 00:19:15,500
We'll get back to this at
a later date, okay, Yuki?

261
00:19:17,260 --> 00:19:18,090
Honestly.

262
00:19:19,160 --> 00:19:19,990
What? No!

263
00:19:20,073 --> 00:19:22,942
Tenka was just dropping
by to say hello, I swear!

264
00:19:24,060 --> 00:19:24,890
Uh...

265
00:19:24,973 --> 00:19:27,440
That honestly was meant for you! Huh?

266
00:19:28,460 --> 00:19:31,597
Evidently, you still don't
understand who your master is.

267
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:32,860
You need discipline.

268
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:34,042
Brace yourself.

269
00:19:41,940 --> 00:19:45,860
Why are you already tired when
I just called you? Sorry, Ms.

