271
00:19:48,540 --> 00:19:49,370
Oh?

272
00:19:49,453 --> 00:19:50,283
Extra training?

273
00:19:50,366 --> 00:19:51,417
Sounds like something she'd do.

274
00:19:51,500 --> 00:19:53,177
