love levels look something like this.

287
00:20:30,600 --> 00:20:33,640
If I don't use my brain,
I can't win the game.

288
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:36,297
It is all exactly as I envisioned it.

289
00:20:36,380 --> 00:20:38,140
