294
00:20:48,900 --> 00:20:52,517
Currently, I'm not detecting anyone
in need of rescue near the gateway.

295
00:20:52,600 --> 00:20:55,240
However, more and more
Shuki are converging.

296
00:20:55,640 --> 00:20:57,100
