302
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:34,040
Now! Got it!

303
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:36,720
It's time to fall down!

304
00:21:38,140 --> 00:21:40,157
This is how I became...

305
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:41,540
This is the story!

306
00:21:41,880 --> 00:21:43,140
Supreme Commander!

307
00:21:43,700 --> 00:21:45,760
Of how I became a hero!

308
00:21:53,500 --> 00:21:54,330
Coco...

309
00:21:54,980 --> 00:21:55,810
Nalan...

310
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:58,580
I swear on my life I will find you.

311
00:22:00,200 --> 00:22:06,020
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

312
00:22:48,180 --> 00:22:51,860
Let's do it.

